<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Mr. Dostoevsky returns four months after starting lamotrigine. He has had no seizure since the one in the third week of the titration, about sixteen weeks ago, including during the stomach illness last month, when he missed two doses. He has no side effects. He has not gambled for five months, although urges came back when an advance from his publisher arrived; he called his therapist and a friend instead. He has finished twelve therapy sessions and now goes every two weeks, and he attends Gamblers Anonymous most weeks. The debt repayment plan has started. He is planning a long research trip abroad in late summer. His mood is good. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Seizures</td><td>None for about sixteen weeks</td></tr><tr><td>Lamotrigine</td><td>100 mg twice daily; no side effects; two doses missed during the stomach illness</td></tr><tr><td>Gambling</td><td>None for five months; urges handled with his coping plan</td></tr><tr><td>Plans</td><td>A long trip abroad in late summer</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

